WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.170
If you rebuild the same queue every morning, save the filter instead.

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:08.450
In All Tickets, choose the priority shortcut that defines your morning review.

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:10.940
Open Views and name the current filters.

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:13.750
Save the view, then clear the queue filters.

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:16.460
Open Views again and select the saved name.

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:19.375
The matching filter returns without having to rebuild it.
